            "heading": "How often does the b-MoLa filter need replacing?",
            "answer": "<p>The NCCO catalyst in b-MoLa purifiers lasts up to 12 years under normal use — far longer than conventional HEPA or activated carbon filters which need replacing every 6–12 months.</p>"
