            "heading": "Is b-MoLa safe for children and pets?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The NCCO catalyst is a non-toxic mineral. Ozone output is below 0.03 ppm — well under the international UL 867 safety limit of 0.05 ppm. b-MoLa is used in kindergartens and elderly care homes.</p>"
